# Testing

Read `docs/TESTING.md`.

## MUST

- Keep ≥80% coverage thresholds
- Prefer behavior tests of `handler` outcomes
- Mock `jose` rather than hitting Cognito JWKS

## MUST NOT

- Delete tests only to greenwash coverage
- Lower `coverageThreshold` without human approval
